1
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:12,060
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,100
=Episode 9=

3
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,060
Mr. He, what did you
want to see me about?

4
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:25,540
Ms. Luo,

5
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,180
I heard from your director

6
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:29,740
that you're the only one
refusing to sign.

7
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,540
I just want to focus on dancing.

8
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:33,420
I know you do.

9
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,860
So why don't we make things easier
for each other?

10
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:37,700
Don't make this difficult for me.

11
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:38,420
But...

12
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,540
Yunshan and Xinghai Ballet Company

13
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,180
are only signing a three-year
business deal.

14
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:43,220
It's not like you're doing
five years in prison.

15
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,060
Is it really that hard?

16
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,300
You know how Mr. Chen feels about me,

17
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,700
and you still want me to sign?

18
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,860
I don't know anything about that.

19
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,780
I'm only responsible
for getting your company signed.

20
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,420
That's my job.

21
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:01,180
Fine.

22
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:03,580
I'll sign.

23
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:07,860
(Xiyu,)

24
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,060
(this is the only way)

25
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,940
(I can keep you close to me.)

26
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,580
Everyone, stop what you're doing.

27
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:20,140
Yunshan Group is hosting our first
get-together tomorrow afternoon.

28
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:22,380
Director,

29
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:23,900
I...

30
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:25,180
I'm not feeling very well.

31
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:26,260
I think I'll sit this one out.

32
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:27,380
Xiyu,

33
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:28,900
you're our principal.

34
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:30,180
It's our first get-together.

35
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,300
How could you not show up?

36
00:01:31,660 --> 00:01:32,540
Just hang in there,

37
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:33,260
okay?

38
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,100
Where is everyone from the company?

39
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:07,820
The dancers?

40
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:10,260
They're changing into swimsuits
in the guest rooms.

41
00:02:10,940 --> 00:02:11,620
Swimsuits?

42
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:14,220
Isn't this a business reception?

43
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:15,980
Of course it is.

44
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,260
But for you ladies,

45
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:19,220
it's more like

46
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:21,020
a swimsuit party.

47
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:32,900
What are you waiting for?

48
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:35,460
I picked this one out for you myself.

49
00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:37,780
We're dancers at Xinghai!

50
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:38,820
We're not here to drink with you

51
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:40,100
or entertain you!

52
00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:42,020
I'm not wearing this.

53
00:02:43,270 --> 00:02:44,310
Hey...

54
00:02:48,140 --> 00:02:48,500
Oh...

55
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:50,620
I'm so sorry.

56
00:02:50,620 --> 00:02:51,460
(Zhonghai Banshan No. 1)
Ms. Luo, I...

57
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:54,340
Look what I've done to your clothes.

58
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:56,620
Why don't you just put on the swimsuit?

59
00:02:57,540 --> 00:02:58,460
We're all

60
00:02:58,460 --> 00:02:59,620
waiting to see you perform

61
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:01,580
ballet in a swimsuit.

62
00:03:05,540 --> 00:03:06,780
Is that what you want too, Mr. He?

63
00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:11,100
I'll go with what Mr. Chen says.

64
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:25,540
I owed you before.

65
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:29,580
Now we're even.

66
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:32,900
What...

67
00:03:34,470 --> 00:03:35,430
Oh, wow.

68
00:03:36,980 --> 00:03:39,180
If I'd known you two had history,

69
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:41,540
I would've backed off.

70
00:03:43,100 --> 00:03:43,780
But then again,

71
00:03:43,900 --> 00:03:44,940
Luo Xiyu

72
00:03:44,940 --> 00:03:46,700
is with that pretty-boy doctor.

73
00:03:47,340 --> 00:03:49,180
So I guess I got a little payback
for you too.

74
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:06,780
(All this just to become principal?)

75
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:09,220
(Drinking and smiling for favors?)

76
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,140
(Didn't know you had it in you.)

77
00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:16,620
(Yunshan and Xinghai have only signed
a three-year business deal.)

78
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:18,900
(It's not like you're doing
five years in prison.)

79
00:04:19,540 --> 00:04:20,420
(I'll go with what Mr. Chen says.)

80
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:29,580
I won't attend any more

81
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:31,020
Yunshan business events.

82
00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:39,140
That's an internal matter
for your company.

83
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:40,220
It has nothing to do with me.

84
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,780
But you're in charge of the partnership

85
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:44,060
between Xinghai and Yunshan now.

86
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:45,340
That's right. I am.

87
00:04:45,820 --> 00:04:47,340
But the contract has
already been signed.

88
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:49,300
You want me to make an exception
for you?

89
00:04:49,660 --> 00:04:50,820
I'm not asking for special treatment.

90
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:51,340
I just...

91
00:04:51,340 --> 00:04:52,140
Luo Xiyu,

92
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:55,380
why do you still not know your place?

93
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:57,460
Why should you be the exception?

94
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:15,100
Here's your ring back.

95
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:18,140
Now we're even.

96
00:05:19,420 --> 00:05:20,220
Keep it.

97
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:25,820
It's not worth anything anyway.

98
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:32,500
Fine.

99
00:05:34,380 --> 00:05:35,660
I'll leave Xinghai Ballet Company.

100
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:40,860
What did you just say?

101
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:42,740
I said I'll leave
Xinghai Ballet Company.

102
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:44,820
So you don't want to be Xinghai
Ballet Company's principal anymore?

103
00:05:47,420 --> 00:05:48,540
You're giving up your ballet dream?

104
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:55,140
You and Yunshan are forcing me to.

105
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:58,220
You seemed pretty good at drinking
and smiling for favors before.

106
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:01,380
So why act all innocent now?

107
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:19,700
What are you doing?

108
00:06:20,140 --> 00:06:21,460
How are you supposed to go out
like that?

109
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:22,410
♪I miss you♪

110
00:06:22,410 --> 00:06:25,590
♪It is as natural as breathing♪

111
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:28,820
Wear mine for now.

112
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:32,770
♪Falling for you has become a habit♪

113
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:34,540
Mr. He,

114
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:36,260
there's an urgent contract
that needs your signature.

115
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:38,230
♪The traces you left on my heart remain♪

116
00:06:38,230 --> 00:06:41,770
♪No busy signal can drown them out♪

117
00:06:41,770 --> 00:06:46,460
♪No cold night wind can blow them away♪

118
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:50,260
Come in.

119
00:06:50,260 --> 00:06:51,090
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

120
00:06:51,090 --> 00:06:54,690
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

121
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:58,540
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

122
00:06:58,540 --> 00:06:59,420
What happened to you?

123
00:07:01,540 --> 00:07:04,610
♪I swallowed every lie♪

124
00:07:05,940 --> 00:07:07,180
My shirt

125
00:07:07,380 --> 00:07:08,580
got stained with ink.

126
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:10,620
♪All my pain♪

127
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:11,340
Please sign this.

128
00:07:11,340 --> 00:07:13,420
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

129
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:15,550
♪Your greatest charm is all in my head♪

130
00:07:15,550 --> 00:07:17,340
♪It's all just my imagination♪

131
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:19,070
♪I dreamed up every little moment♪

132
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:20,850
♪The sweetness was never even real♪

133
00:07:21,140 --> 00:07:21,860
(Oh my.)

134
00:07:22,620 --> 00:07:23,660
(Luo Xiyu,)

135
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:25,260
(what are you thinking?)

136
00:07:27,130 --> 00:07:29,270
♪Your greatest magic is my weakness♪

137
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:31,050
♪I just can't control myself♪

138
00:07:31,050 --> 00:07:32,700
♪That's why I keep falling♪

139
00:07:32,700 --> 00:07:34,530
♪For a love that was never real♪

140
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:35,820
What's wrong?

141
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:37,340
Hand me the dirty shirt.

142
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:38,300
I'll get it cleaned for you.

143
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:40,540
I...

144
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:41,860
threw it away.

145
00:07:42,820 --> 00:07:43,580
You threw it away?

146
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:46,140
That's not like you.

147
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:48,420
You're asking too many questions.

148
00:07:54,380 --> 00:07:54,980
What's wrong?

149
00:07:58,420 --> 00:07:58,820
You...

150
00:07:58,820 --> 00:08:00,420
bring me another shirt later.

151
00:08:16,820 --> 00:08:17,500
Um...

152
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:20,180
I'll return your shirt after I wash it.

153
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:21,900
And...

154
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:24,500
what I came to say today is,

155
00:08:25,020 --> 00:08:26,820
I won't attend any more Yunshan events.

156
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:32,060
Go ask your director.

157
00:08:33,020 --> 00:08:34,420
We've already signed a contract.

158
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:36,060
If you do that,

159
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:38,260
you'll owe 2 million
in breach-of-contract penalties.

160
00:08:38,900 --> 00:08:39,580
How much?

161
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:44,820
(Darn capitalists.)

162
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:57,580
Mr. He,

163
00:08:57,900 --> 00:08:58,980
tomorrow at 10 AM,

164
00:08:58,980 --> 00:08:59,460
you're meeting

165
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:00,340
Mr. Chen from JCL

166
00:09:00,340 --> 00:09:01,340
to discuss the next phase
of cooperation.

167
00:09:01,700 --> 00:09:02,220
Then at two...

168
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:03,220
Wait.

169
00:09:08,340 --> 00:09:09,740
I have a question for you.

170
00:09:10,860 --> 00:09:11,580
So...

171
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,660
I have this friend.

172
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:18,340
He's into a girl,

173
00:09:18,340 --> 00:09:19,980
but she already has a boyfriend.

174
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:21,140
What do you think he should do...

175
00:09:21,140 --> 00:09:22,140
To win her back

176
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:23,620
from the other guy

177
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:24,500
and win her heart?

178
00:09:28,740 --> 00:09:29,580
Swallow your pride.

179
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:30,700
Give her what she likes.

180
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:32,700
That's what his rival is doing.

181
00:09:33,340 --> 00:09:34,220
Learn from him first,

182
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:35,260
then beat him at his own game.

183
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:40,820
Simply put,

184
00:09:41,300 --> 00:09:42,900
when you're around Luo Xiyu,

185
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:44,340
put your pride aside,

186
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:45,700
do whatever she likes,

187
00:09:46,340 --> 00:09:47,180
and keep chasing her.

188
00:09:47,300 --> 00:09:48,580
Don't give Zhang Jinghang any chance.

189
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:50,060
I... I'm not talking about me.

190
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:52,100
It's...

191
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,380
My friend

192
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:57,140
wouldn't do something like that.

193
00:09:57,780 --> 00:09:58,420
Right.

194
00:09:59,140 --> 00:10:00,140
Then tell

195
00:10:00,420 --> 00:10:01,740
your friend

196
00:10:02,060 --> 00:10:05,020
to wait for Zhang Jinghang
and Luo Xiyu's wedding invitation.

197
00:10:05,220 --> 00:10:06,300
I'm serious. It's not me.

198
00:10:06,300 --> 00:10:07,140
It's my friend!

199
00:10:10,700 --> 00:10:11,180
Right.

200
00:10:12,340 --> 00:10:14,420
Your friend likes Luo Xiyu too.

201
00:10:14,820 --> 00:10:16,460
(Party A: Luo Xiyu)
You even put her name on the contract.

202
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:05,030
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

203
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:11,240
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

204
00:11:12,570 --> 00:11:15,590
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

205
00:11:15,590 --> 00:11:18,580
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

206
00:11:19,100 --> 00:11:21,300
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

207
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:24,750
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

208
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:31,000
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

209
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:37,600
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

210
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:40,890
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

211
00:11:40,890 --> 00:11:44,640
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

212
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:47,580
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

213
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:51,840
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

214
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:54,370
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

215
00:11:54,370 --> 00:11:58,040
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

216
00:11:58,510 --> 00:12:00,390
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

217
00:12:00,390 --> 00:12:04,620
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

218
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:08,420
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

219
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:11,430
♪I could give you another future♪

220
00:12:11,750 --> 00:12:17,980
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

221
00:12:17,980 --> 00:12:20,250
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

222
00:12:20,250 --> 00:12:21,890
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

223
00:12:21,890 --> 00:12:23,750
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

224
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,940
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

225
00:12:25,940 --> 00:12:29,840
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

226
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:33,830
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪
